{
  "_comment": [
    "The words of a career of runs for the score: the Challenges screen (challenges.*), the showroom of cars by tier",
    "(showroom.*), the high scores (highscores.*) and the card after a Challenge's road (result.challenge.*). A setting",
    "says its own over them (its title on the Challenges screen, say). {name} is a value the game fills in. A line that",
    "starts or ends with a space keeps it: it is joined to others. The placeholders:",
    "challenges.banked, showroom.count: {score} the banked score; {open} {count} the cars open and all of them",
    "challenges.next_tier: {tier} {short} the next tier and the points it still wants",
    "challenges.drive.next, challenges.card.go, result.challenge.road, result.challenge.next: {road} {roads}",
    "challenges.why.missing: {roads} the roads the install lacks",
    "challenges.failed, showroom.failed: {error}",
    "challenges.card.missing: {count}",
    "challenges.card.best, challenges.road.best, challenges.road.this_go, showroom.shut: {score} ({short} the points to go)",
    "challenges.card.new: {roads}",
    "challenges.card.golds, highscores.golds: {golds} {roads}",
    "challenges.lock.challenge: {challenge}",
    "challenges.lock.score, challenges.lock.gold: {short}",
    "challenges.road.lap, challenges.road.laps: {laps}",
    "challenges.road.medals: {bronze} {silver} {gold} the scores that win them",
    "showroom.tier, result.challenge.tier: {tier}",
    "showroom.taken: {car}",
    "highscores.density: {density} the player's traffic density, 1 the road's own",
    "highscores.finished, result.challenge.more: {count}",
    "result.challenge.silver: {gold}; result.challenge.bronze: {silver}; result.challenge.no_medal: {bronze}",
    "result.challenge.done: {total}",
    "result.challenge.banked: {score} {gained}",
    "result.challenge.new_cars: {cars}",
    "result.challenge.opened: {challenges}"
  ],
